OL,3,AAnthropic shares expected to soar as AI
OL,4,Afirm makes stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FAI firm Anthropic is listed publicly
OL,7,Ffor the first time, with the stock
OL,8,Fmarket in New York now open
OL,10,FAccording to data from the Nasdaq,
OL,11,Fshare prices are set to open at $105, a
OL,12,Fsteep jump from the $83 set last night
OL,13,F- take a closer look at some of the
OL,14,Fnumbers here
OL,16,FThe company behind AI product Claude
OL,17,Fwas valued at $1.5tn (#1.14tn) after
OL,18,Fraising a record $81bn ahead of its
OL,19,Fstock market debut
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
