OL,3,AAnthropic shares expected to soar as AI
OL,4,Afirm makes stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe flotation is being seen as a
OL,7,Fcrucial test for the AI sector, with
OL,8,FAnthropic the first purely AI-focused
OL,9,Ffirm to sell shares publicly
OL,11,FThe seven founders who set up Anthropic
OL,12,Fin 2021 will become multi-billionaires
OL,13,F- we've looked at why private companies
OL,14,Fdecide to sell shares publicly here
